```console
$ scherzo-cloud auth login --help
Sign in to Scherzo Cloud

Usage: scherzo-cloud auth login [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --force                Start a new sign-in even if you're already signed in
      --json                 Emit newline-delimited JSON events
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                 Print help

```
